achievement: hhc

= High Human Culture Discredited

With the Rights of Sentience in law, the officer corps opened to every species and the Bureau's report on the human-first groups in every newsroom, the movement collapses. Its donors are named, its admirals retired, its clubs empty. "High Human Culture" becomes a phrase people use as a joke, and then not at all.
